**Weaknesses holding GMem back:**
- The Φ(z) noise-to-index mapping is mathematically ill-posed and completely unspecified — this is a significant reproducibility hole
- The "50× speedup" mixes batch size differences, architectural (LightningDiT), and REPA loss contributions; this is misleading
