### Positioning Rationale

AlldayWalker sits above EmbodiedMAE (5.0, rejected) due to stronger novelty in adapter design and more comprehensive empirical validation including real-world deployment. It is comparable to SigMap (5.3, accepted) — both have domain-specific problem formulations, reasonable baselines, and unverified critical mechanisms. AlldayWalker has stronger real-world validation than SigMap but suffers from the same missing ablation pattern.

