**Empirical Support:**  
This is NavFoM's strongest dimension. Seven public benchmarks, multiple embodiment types, real-world experiments on multiple robot platforms — this breadth clearly exceeds EmbodiedMAE (two platforms, manipulation only) and SigMap (simulated data only). Competitive with or slightly better than Dens3R and AgileThinker in terms of empirical volume and real-world validation.

