**Novelty**: The paper reframes data whitening as a Euclidean-space transformation and proposes class-wise Cholesky decomposition + iterative SM algorithm. The problem exists in prior work (max-min margin machine, MCVSVM). Comparable to `difference_backprop` — the novelty exists in principle but is undercut by theoretical errors and ignoring relevant prior art.

