The watermarking paper scored 5.3 (reject) and had a more rigorous theoretical foundation with good experiments but missed formal guarantees. AUTO-RT has similar structural issues but with more consequential empirical gaps. I place AUTO-RT slightly below the watermarking paper at ~4.3.

