|---|---|---|
| distributional_equivalence | 8.0 | Much stronger theory & broader scope |
| attention_head_count | 7.0 | Stronger theory + better experiments |
| neural_posterior_estimation | 6.7 | Comparable novelty, somewhat stronger experiments |
| flatter_tokens | 5.5 | Similar novelty tier, better empirical coverage |
