Both are LLM analysis papers with benchmark/evaluation contributions. The answerset paper presents a clean formalization and rigorous evaluation but is limited in scope and has qualitative attribution of causes. The min-p paper is stronger in rigor and novelty of contribution (Best-of-N sweep is more substantial than prompting strategies). **Min-p is clearly above this.**

