Calgacus has elegant technical novelty (novel steganographic protocol), compelling safety implications, and clear reproducibility. Its weaknesses are lack of human evaluation and limited comparative benchmarking. The min-p paper has comparable empirical rigor but is primarily a critique rather than a novel constructive advance; its "blueprint" falls short of the promised scope. **Min-p is slightly below this.**

