**Compared to LLMs-Hide-Text (7.0):** That paper has a more elegant core idea and better discussion of broader implications, but is missing critical steganalysis experiments and formal security analysis — bigger empirical gaps than AUTO-RT. AUTO-RT's empirical coverage is stronger (18 models vs. plausibility demos), but LLMs-Hide-Text's theoretical framing and conceptual novelty is higher. Both are in similar territory.

