I'd estimate CANON falls around 6.2-6.5. The review says its weaknesses are limited in scope and have non-systematic hyperparameter analysis, but the theoretical insights and empirical breadth are strong. Given that DGPO (a similar-quality paper, arguably with flashier results) scored 6.0, and CANON's theoretical contribution is cleaner (DR.GRPO as special case) plus its multi-model evaluation is more comprehensive, I'd give CANON ~6.3.
