| **Technical soundness** | Moderate; alternating updates and cosine similarity are reasonable but weakly justified | Moderate-high; Hessian analysis + linear theory gap | Good; RL formulation is sound, stabilization techniques well-motivated | Good; Gaussian theoretical model + empirical validation | Strong; theoretical convergence + extensive ablations |
