**Positioning:** CALM sits between MermaidFlow (5.3) and AgileThinker (6.5). The novelty of the co-evolution paradigm for AHD is genuine, the experiments are solid and include statistical significance testing, and the practical contribution (local GPU vs. API) is meaningful. Its weaknesses are "nice-to-have" improvements rather than fatal flaws. This places it closer to AgileThinker than MermaidFlow — around the borderline accept range.

