**RLKV (avg 4.5, Reject):** RL-guided KV cache compression for reasoning LLMs, comprehensive evaluation on 2 models. Weaknesses include limited interpretability and lack of broader generalization. *SPELL comparison:* SPELL substantially outperforms here in evaluation comprehensiveness (12 models vs. 2) and addresses a more fundamental capability gap.

