SPELL's primary strengths align with AgileThinker-level quality or above: genuinely novel framework, exceptional evaluation breadth (12 diverse models 4B–32B across 6 benchmarks), consistent improvements including on hard reasoning models (Qwen3), and validated automated curriculum design with ablations.

