**NavFoM** proposes a cross-embodiment/cross-task navigation foundation model with TVI tokens for camera/temporal encoding, BATS for efficient inference, and a massive 8M-sample dataset spanning 4 embodiment types and tasks. It achieves state-of-the-art or competitive results on 7 benchmarks with zero-shot generalization.

