COAD sits between Cal #53 (5.0, Accept) and Cal #32 (3.0, Reject). The novel task formulation and substantial benchmark push it above the rejected action anticipation paper. The inconsistent EPIC-KITCHENS results and missing computational analysis prevent it from reaching Cal #56 (6.5). The profile is most comparable to Cal #53, but slightly lower due to the more damaging cross-dataset failure. I place the paper at approximately **4.8**.

