GUI-Spotlight has: (1) strong headline results with impressive data efficiency, (2) valuable empirical insights including negative results, (3) clear practical value. But it lacks: (1) tool ablation, (2) computational cost analysis, (3) failure analysis, (4) key baseline comparison (RL without tools). These are significant gaps for a top venue.

