**Paper under review:** "A Tale of Two Geometries: Adaptive Optimizers and Non-Euclidean Descent" — a pure theory paper that unifies the analysis of adaptive optimizers (Adam, Shampoo) and normalized steepest descent (NSD) under different smoothness notions, extends adaptive smoothness to nonconvex settings, proves acceleration under adaptive smoothness, and introduces adaptive variance for dimension-free rates.

