The paper has rigorous results for the structural components (Theorems 1, 3 — fixed points, invariant manifolds) and the linear case (Theorem 4). The nonlinear analysis (quadratic/ReLU) relies on heuristic arguments and approximations. This is a meaningful limitation but not uncommon in theoretical ML. Compared to:
