**Paper under review:** SPS/SPS+ — Differentially Private Fine-Tuning Using Dataset Distillation. Claims the first generation-based method to outperform DP-SGD on image classification (CIFAR-10/100 at ε=1).

### Dimension-by-dimension comparison:

**Novelty:**
