### The Paper Under Review
**"A Principled Approach to Chain-of-Thought Monitorability in Reasoning Models"** — formalizes CoT monitorability as constrained optimization, identifies sparse gradient failure of naive RL, proposes prior-guided distillation pipeline using a stronger model to transform CoT traces, shows ~10% faithfulness improvement and ~60% CoT length reduction.

