- **π³** (8.0): Strong empirical SOTA, clear problem identification, some initialization dependency concerns. SIGMADOCK has similarly strong empirical results and a cleaner methodological contribution (no reliance on pretrained models), but more limited evaluation scope (re-docking only).
- **Quotient-Space Diffusion** (7.5): Rigorous theory + consistent empirical gains. SIGMADOCK has stronger empirical gains (dramatic improvement over baselines) but a narrower evaluation setting.
